  id: skewer
  displayName: Tetrafluoro Skewer
  description: A refrigerant-driven ice spike skewers cars and leaves them crusted
    in frost. Press fire again while it flies to break it into a cone of shards. Its
    compressor steals a little of your cabin AC.
  role: FREEZING LANCE
  strength: Pierces two cars, chills their drive and can burst into a close-range
    shard cone.
  weakness: One precise spike; the cone needs a second trigger press before impact.
  contentOrder: 20
  damage: 82
  fireRate: 0.9
  speed: 100
  blastRadius: 0
